1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Seorang raja di India

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,620
pernah bikin pesta

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,570
pernikahan tiga hari.

4
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,620
Pengantinnya:

5
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:06,730
anjing.

6
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,490
Dia Nawab Junagadh,

7
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:09,830
penguasa kerajaan kecil

8
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,640
di India barat.

9
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,530
Anjingnya ratusan.

10
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:14,900
Tiap ekor punya kandang

11
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,690
dan pengasuh sendiri.

12
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,810
Tahun 1920-an,

13
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,230
anjing kesayangannya,

14
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,250
Roshanara,

15
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:22,830
dinikahkan dengan Bobby,

16
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:25,130
anjing milik
raja tetangga.

17
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,650
Bobby disambut di stasiun

18
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:28,160
pakai band militer,

19
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,990
dan 250 anjing

20
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:31,390
berbaju sutra.

21
00:00:31,410 --> 00:00:32,450
Roshanara diarak

22
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,110
naik tandu perak.

23
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,220
Satu hari pestanya

24
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,630
dijadikan
hari libur kerajaan.

25
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,000
Gubernur Jenderal Inggris

26
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:39,760
diundang,

27
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,490
tapi menolak datang.

28
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:42,740
Biayanya?

29
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,510
Konon,

30
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:44,950
setara miliaran rupiah

31
00:00:44,970 --> 00:00:46,490
zaman sekarang.

32
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,680
Tahun 1947,

33
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:49,720
sang Nawab kabur

34
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,650
ke Pakistan naik pesawat,

35
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:52,810
bawa harta,

36
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:53,470
istri,

37
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:55,270
dan anjing-anjingnya.

38
00:00:55,290 --> 00:00:56,090
Konon,

39
00:00:56,110 --> 00:00:57,670
satu istrinya
turun sebentar

40
00:00:57,690 --> 00:00:58,650
menjemput anaknya

41
00:00:58,670 --> 00:01:00,170
yang ketinggalan.

42
00:01:00,190 --> 00:01:01,490
Kursinya langsung diisi

43
00:01:01,510 --> 00:01:03,220
dua ekor anjing.

44
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:05,780
Pesawatnya berangkat.
